<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Oct unemployment rises to 14 percent.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Oct unemployment rises to 14 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details  on Monday.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	    Oct	  Sept     Oct 95</p>
<p>    percentage			   14.0	  13.7	 14.4</p>
<p>    total			     120,722     118,083    125,691</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
